//RS /// code using any effect (here `core.sys`) must fail cleanly at build time
//RS /// (E1258), not defer to a runtime instantiation failure. This check lives in
//RS /// the CLI's post-compile effect-budget pass (`Source/CmdCompile.rs`), so it
//RS /// needs the real subprocess (not the `jet::compile_plugin` library call the
//RS /// `tests/ui` `@plugin_target` harness drives).
